### 健康检查
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### 注册
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@lifelab.test",
  "password": "password123",
  "displayName": "LifeLab 用户"
}

### 登录（复制响应中的 accessToken 到下面的 token 变量）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@lifelab.test",
  "password": "password123"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### 获取在线模板
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/templates

### 创建实验
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/experiments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "55555555-5555-4555-8555-555555555555",
  "name": "睡前一小时不看手机",
  "hypothesis": "减少睡前屏幕刺激可以改善睡眠",
  "description": "记录两周的睡眠变化",
  "coverColor": "purple",
  "startDateMillis": 1800000000000,
  "durationDays": 14,
  "baselineDays": 7,
  "interventionDays": 7,
  "metrics": [
    {
      "id": "55555555-5555-4555-8555-555555555501",
      "name": "是否完成干预",
      "type": "YES_NO",
      "required": true,
      "sortOrder": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "55555555-5555-4555-8555-555555555502",
      "name": "晨间精力",
      "type": "SCORE",
      "required": true,
      "sortOrder": 1
    }
  ]
}

### 获取当前用户实验
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/experiments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 提交打卡
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/records
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "66666666-6666-4666-8666-666666666666",
  "experimentId": "55555555-5555-4555-8555-555555555555",
  "recordedAtMillis": 1800000100000,
  "note": "今天执行顺利",
  "values": [
    {
      "metricId": "55555555-5555-4555-8555-555555555501",
      "value": "true"
    },
    {
      "metricId": "55555555-5555-4555-8555-555555555502",
      "value": "8"
    }
  ]
}

### 查询实验打卡记录
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/records?experimentId=55555555-5555-4555-8555-555555555555
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
